Commodore 64 ROMs
=================

Downloaded from http://www.unusedino.de/ec64/technical2.html
Credited in turn to ftp://ftp.funet.fi/pub/cbm

basic.rom
---------
Commodore 64 BASIC V2. The first and only revision.

kernal.rom
----------
Commodore 64 KERNAL ROM Revision 3. The last revision, also used in
the C128's C64 mode.

character.rom
-------------
The character generator ROM.

kernal-sx64.rom
---------------
The SX-64's KERNAL, 251104-04. It boots with the SX-64's banner and
colours, and loads from device 8 rather than tape. Computer.new(kernal:
:sx64) fits it, as --model sx64 does.

Downloaded from
https://www.zimmers.net/anonftp/pub/cbm/firmware/computers/c64/kernal.sx.251104-04.bin
SHA-1 aa136e91ecf3c5ac64f696b3dbcbfc5ba0871c98.

kernal-pet64.rom
----------------
The KERNAL of the PET 64, 4064 and Educator 64, 901246-01. It boots
with the "**** COMMODORE 4064  BASIC V2.0 ****" banner and a white
cursor, and its interrupt routine keeps the border, background and
sprite colours black unless bit 7 of $0286 is set. Computer.new(kernal:
:pet64) fits it, as --model pet64 does.

Downloaded from
https://www.zimmers.net/anonftp/pub/cbm/firmware/computers/c64/kernal.4064.901246-01.bin
MD5 da92801e3a03b005b746a4dd0b639c7c.

dos1541.rom
-----------
The 1541 disk drive's DOS 2.6, 16 KB for $C000-$FFFF: 325302-01
($C000-$DFFF) followed by 901229-05 ($E000-$FFFF). Drive1541 loads it.

Both halves downloaded from
https://www.zimmers.net/anonftp/pub/cbm/firmware/drives/new/1541/
(1541-c000.325302-01.bin and 1541-e000.901229-05.bin) and concatenated.
SHA-1 ab16f56989b27d89babe5f89c5a8cb3da71a82f0.

Commodore VIC-20 ROMs
=====================

Downloaded from
https://www.zimmers.net/anonftp/pub/cbm/firmware/computers/vic20/
Vic20::Bus maps them.

vic20/basic.rom
---------------
VIC-20 BASIC V2, 901486-01, for $C000-$DFFF.
SHA-1 587d1e90950675ab6b12d91248a3f0d640d02e8d.

vic20/kernal-pal.rom
--------------------
The PAL KERNAL, 901486-07, for $E000-$FFFF.
SHA-1 ce0137ed69f003a299f43538fa9eee27898e621e.

vic20/kernal-ntsc.rom
---------------------
The NTSC KERNAL, 901486-06, for $E000-$FFFF.
SHA-1 06de7ec017a5e78bd6746d89c2ecebb646efeb19.

vic20/character.rom
-------------------
The character generator ROM, 901460-03, for $8000-$8FFF.
SHA-1 4fd85ab6647ee2ac7ba40f729323f2472d35b9b4.
